// scaffold standard library — prelude.
//
// The public entry point is `scaffold.wcl`, which a template opts into
// with `import <scaffold.wcl>`; that imports this file, which pulls in
// every part of the schema. Right now the schema is a single part
// (`core.wcl`); the prelude exists so the library can grow without
// templates having to chase new imports.

namespace scaffold

import <core.wcl>             // @document Project + property/file/folder blocks
